function parse(){return `${context()}${pageHead('STAGE 02 · 系统自动化','多模态解析与质量准入','统一解析文本、表格、图表、图片和音视频，并在抽取前完成质量检查。','<button class="btn">质量规则</button><button class="btn primary" data-action="run-parse">▶ 执行解析</button>')}<div class="grid cols-3"><div class="card metric"><small>解析队列</small><strong>12</strong><span class="status warn">3 处理中</span></div><div class="card metric"><small>格式覆盖</small><strong>8</strong><span class="status info">文本 / 表格 / 音视频</span></div><div class="card card-pad"><div class="card-title"><h3>平均质量</h3><b>91</b></div>${[['文本完整性',97],['表格识别率',89],['业务相关度',93]].map(x=>`<div class="qbar"><span>${x[0]}</span><span class="bar"><i style="width:${x[1]}%"></i></span><b>${x[1]}</b></div>`).join('')}</div></div><div class="panel" style="margin-top:15px"><div class="panel-head"><h3>解析明细 · ${domain().scene}</h3><span class="status info">准入阈值 ≥ 80</span></div><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>文档</th><th>识别内容</th><th>进度</th><th>质量分</th><th>业务相关度</th><th>准入状态</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>${demoDocs.map((x,i)=>`<tr><td><b>${x.name}</b></td><td>${['文本 34 · 表格 8 · 图表 6','文本 18 · 表格 3','工作表 6 · 关系 24','文本 22 · 图表 9'][i]}</td><td>${x.quality}%</td><td>${x.quality}</td><td>${[95,92,89,76][i]}%</td><td>${badge(i===3?'需人工确认':'已准入')}</td><td><button class="btn small" data-action="preview-parse">预览</button></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><div class="action-bar"><span class="spacer"></span><button class="btn primary" data-action="finish-parse">确认准入并配置抽取 →</button></div>`}
function extract(){const set=docSets.find(x=>x.id===state.selectedSet);return `${context()}${pageHead('STAGE 03 · 领域知识管理员','按文档集抽取领域知识','先维护领域知识结构，再为不同标签组合的文档集配置差异化抽取字段。','<button class="btn">规则版本 V3</button><button class="btn primary" data-action="run-extract">运行抽取</button>')}<div class="process-strip"><div class="process-step done"><span>✓</span><div><b>维护知识结构</b><small>定义对象、场景与属性</small></div></div><div class="process-step active"><span>2</span><div><b>绑定文档集与字段</b><small>各文档集独立配置</small></div></div><div class="process-step"><span>3</span><div><b>抽取并消歧</b><small>生成结构化知识</small></div></div></div><div class="panel architecture-card"><div class="panel-head"><h3>${domain().name} · ${domain().scene}知识结构</h3><span class="status ok">已启用</span></div><div class="panel-body definition-grid">${[['对象',domain().object],['场景',domain().scene],['对象关系','归属 / 影响 / 驱动'],['指标度量','数值 / 口径 / 周期'],['策略与规则','阈值 / 触发逻辑'],['行动建议','角色 / 动作 / 时效']].map(x=>`<div class="definition-item"><b>${x[0]}</b><small>${x[1]}</small></div>`).join('')}</div></div><div class="schema-layout"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h3>文档集</h3></div><div class="set-list">${docSets.map(s=>`<div class="set-item ${s.id===set.id?'active':''}" data-set="${s.id}"><b>${s.name}</b><p>${domain().name} + ${domain().object} + ${domain().topic}</p><small>${s.count} 份文档 · ${s.model}</small></div>`).join('')}</div></div><div class="panel field-board"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>${set.name}</h3><small>目标模型：${set.model}</small></div><button class="btn small" data-action="copy-schema">复制配置</button></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="notice">本配置仅作用于当前文档集；切换文档集可看到不同字段。</div><div class="field-group" style="margin-top:18px"><div class="field-group-title">自动继承的场景标签</div><div class="field-list">${['责任中心','业务域','对象','主题','适用区域'].map(x=>`<span class="field-chip required"><i></i>${x}</span>`).join('')}</div></div><div class="field-group"><div class="field-group-title">${set.model}专属字段</div><div class="field-list">${state.fields[set.id].map(x=>`<span class="field-chip custom"><i></i>${x}<button class="remove" data-action="remove-field" data-field="${x}">×</button></span>`).join('')}<button class="add-field" data-action="add-field">＋ 添加字段</button></div></div><div class="action-bar"><span class="status ok">已自动保存</span><span class="spacer"></span><button class="btn primary" data-action="finish-extract">生成结构化知识 →</button></div></div></div></div>`}
function fieldSourceOptions(source){return ['文档自身标签','场景标签','自动抽取','用户填写'].map(x=>`<option ${x===source?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}
function fieldTypeOptions(type){return ['枚举','文本'].map(x=>`<option ${x===(type==='长文本'?'文本':type)?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}
function fieldResultBadge(source){return source==='自动抽取'?'<span class="status info">智能抽取</span>':source==='用户填写'?'<span class="status warn">任务内填写默认值</span>':'<span class="status ok">随文档自动带出</span>'}
function modelFieldTable(model){return `<div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table model-field-table"><thead><tr><th>字段名称</th><th>字段类型</th><th>取值方式</th><th>标签映射 / 抽取要求 / 枚举值</th><th>结果处理</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody>${model.fields.map((f,i)=>`<tr><td><b>${f[0]}</b></td><td><select>${fieldTypeOptions(f[1])}</select></td><td><select>${fieldSourceOptions(f[2])}</select></td><td>${f[1]==='枚举'?`<div class="enum-cell"><span>${f[3]}</span><button class="btn small" data-action="config-enum-values" data-field="${f[0]}">枚举值配置</button></div>`:`<input value="${f[3]}">`}</td><td>${fieldResultBadge(f[2])}</td><td><button class="btn small" data-action="edit-model-field" data-field-index="${i}">编辑</button></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`}
function taskSetCard(set){const selected=state.taskSets.has(set.id);const d=domain();return `<div class="task-set-card ${selected?'selected':''}"><label class="task-set-head"><input class="task-set-check" data-id="${set.id}" type="checkbox" ${selected?'checked':''}><span><b>${set.name}</b><small>${set.count} 条知识 · 默认模型：${set.model}</small></span><span class="status ${selected?'ok':''}">${selected?'已选择':'未选择'}</span></label>${selected?`<div class="task-tag-filter"><small>标签筛选</small>${[['责任中心','财经'],['业务域',d.name],['对象',d.object],['主题',d.topic],['适用区域',d.region]].map(x=>`<label><span>${x[0]}</span><select><option>${x[1]}</option><option>全部</option></select></label>`).join('')}</div>`:''}</div>`}
function extractV2(){const model=knowledgeModels.find(x=>x.id===state.selectedModel);return `${context()}${pageHead('STAGE 03 · 领域知识管理员','知识结构与抽取任务','通过多张知识模型表定义知识结构，再创建任务选择一个或多个知识集执行抽取。','<button class="btn" data-action="create-model">＋ 新建知识模型</button><button class="btn primary" data-action="run-extract-task">运行抽取任务</button>')}<div class="process-strip"><div class="process-step done"><span>✓</span><div><b>维护知识结构</b><small>一张表代表一个知识模型</small></div></div><div class="process-step active"><span>2</span><div><b>创建抽取任务</b><small>多选知识集并按标签筛选</small></div></div><div class="process-step"><span>3</span><div><b>抽取并消歧</b><small>自动带出标签并生成知识</small></div></div></div><div class="notice extraction-guide"><b>字段取值规则：</b>文档自身标签和场景标签直接复用，抽取结果会自动带出文档对应标签；其他非文档标签字段由系统自动抽取。</div><div class="model-selector">${knowledgeModels.map(x=>`<button class="model-card ${x.id===model.id?'active':''}" data-model="${x.id}"><span class="model-table-icon">▦</span><span><b>${x.name}</b><small>${x.desc}</small></span><em>${x.fields.length} 个字段</em></button>`).join('')}</div><div class="panel model-editor"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>${model.name} · 知识模型表</h3><small>一张表定义一种知识结构；字段可复用标签或配置自动抽取</small></div><div><button class="btn small" data-action="add-model-field">＋ 添加字段</button><button class="btn primary small" data-action="save-model">保存结构</button></div></div><div class="source-legend"><span class="status ok">场景标签 / 文档自身标签：自动带出</span><span class="status info">其他字段：自动抽取</span></div>${modelFieldTable(model)}</div><div class="panel extract-task-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>创建抽取任务</h3><small>任务编号 T-20261013-01 · 可选择一个或多个知识集</small></div><span class="status warn">配置中</span></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="form-grid task-basic"><div class="form-field"><label>任务名称</label><input value="经营领域知识抽取任务"></div><div class="form-field"><label>关联知识模型</label><select multiple><option selected>预警规则</option><option selected>维度路径</option><option selected>指标归因</option><option selected>策略工具</option></select></div></div><div class="task-section-title"><span><b>选择知识集</b><small>已选择 ${state.taskSets.size} 个；每个知识集可独立配置标签筛选范围</small></span></div><div class="task-set-list">${docSets.map(taskSetCard).join('')}</div><div class="action-bar"><span class="notice">任务运行时仅处理所选知识集中满足标签条件的知识文档。</span><span class="spacer"></span><button class="btn" data-action="save-extract-task">保存任务</button><button class="btn primary" data-action="run-extract-task">保存并运行</button></div></div></div>`}
function taskDocumentTable(){return `<div class="extract-doc-toolbar"><div class="form-field"><label>来源知识集</label><select><option>${domain().name}知识集</option><option>${domain().scene}专题知识集</option></select></div><div class="search"><span>⌕</span><input placeholder="搜索知识标题或内容"></div><div class="task-doc-tags">${['责任中心：区域TOB','业务域：'+domain().name,'适用区域：中国区'].map(x=>`<button>${x} ×</button>`).join('')}</div><button class="btn small" data-action="add-task-docs">＋ 从知识集添加文档</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table extract-doc-table"><thead><tr><th></th><th>知识文档</th><th>来源</th><th>责任中心</th><th>业务域</th><th>对象</th><th>主题</th><th>适用区域</th><th>质量</th></tr></thead><tbody>${demoDocs.map((x,i)=>`<tr class="${state.extractDocs.has(x.id)?'selected':''}"><td><input class="extract-doc-check" data-id="${x.id}" type="checkbox" ${state.extractDocs.has(x.id)?'checked':''}></td><td><div class="doc-title"><span class="file-icon compact">${x.type}</span><span><b>${x.name}</b><small>${x.owner}</small></span></div></td><td>${x.source}</td><td>${x.tags[0]}</td><td>${domain().name}</td><td>${i===2?'经营单元':'渠道'}</td><td>${i===3?'库存周转':domain().topic}</td><td>${domain().region}</td><td><span class="confidence">${x.quality}</span></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><div class="task-doc-footer"><span>已选择 <b>${state.extractDocs.size}</b> 个文档，只有选中文档会进入本次抽取任务</span><button class="btn small" data-action="clear-task-docs">清空选择</button></div>`}
function taskModelCards(){return `<div class="task-model-grid">${knowledgeModels.map(x=>`<label class="task-model-option ${state.taskModels.has(x.id)?'selected':''}"><input class="task-model-check" data-id="${x.id}" type="checkbox" ${state.taskModels.has(x.id)?'checked':''}><span class="model-table-icon">▦</span><span><b>${x.name}</b><small>${x.desc}</small></span><em>${x.fields.length} 个字段</em></label>`).join('')}</div>`}
function taskUserFillFields(){const fields=[];knowledgeModels.filter(m=>state.taskModels.has(m.id)).forEach(m=>m.fields.filter(f=>f[2]==='用户填写').forEach(f=>{if(!fields.some(x=>x[0]===f[0]))fields.push(f)}));return `<div class="user-fill-note"><span>✎</span><div><b>批次默认值</b><small>以下值将写入本任务选中的 ${state.extractDocs.size} 个文档；未填写字段保持为空，可在专家审核时补齐。</small></div></div><div class="user-fill-grid">${fields.map((f,i)=>`<div class="form-field"><label>${f[0]} <em>${f[1]} · 用户填写</em></label>${f[1]==='枚举'?`<select><option value="">不填写（保持为空）</option>${(sceneEnumOptions[f[0]]||f[3].split(' / ')).map((x,j)=>`<option ${((f[0]==='责任中心'&&j===1)||(f[0]==='业务域'&&j===0))?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select>`:`<input placeholder="可选填；未填写则抽取结果为空">`}<small>${f[1]==='枚举'?'取值来自知识结构的枚举值配置':'文本将作为该批文档的统一默认值'}</small></div>`).join('')}</div>${fields.length?'':'<div class="notice">所选知识结构暂未配置“用户填写”字段。</div>'}`}
function extractSchemaFields(model){const common=new Set(['知识标题','责任中心','业务域','对象','主题','适用区域','文档类型','来源系统','知识备注']);return model.fields.filter(field=>!common.has(field[0])).slice(0,6)}
function extractSchemaPreview(model){const fields=extractSchemaFields(model),relations=model.relations||['归属主题','关联指标','驱动 / 影响'];return `<section class="panel extract-schema-preview"><div class="panel-head"><div><span class="section-kicker">READ-ONLY GRAPH SCHEMA</span><h3>${model.name} Schema</h3><small>由领域专家线下完成建模，IT 已内置至知识底座；当前页面仅用于选择和查看。</small></div><div class="schema-governance"><span>专家建模</span><i>→</i><span>IT 内置</span><i>→</i><b>已启用</b></div></div><div class="schema-preview-body"><div class="schema-visual" aria-label="${model.name} Schema 简要预览"><span class="schema-center"><small>知识类型</small><b>${model.name}</b></span><span class="schema-node schema-subject"><small>主体</small><b>${domain().object}</b></span><span class="schema-node schema-scene"><small>主题</small><b>${domain().topic}</b></span>${fields.slice(0,4).map((field,i)=>`<span class="schema-node schema-field field-${i+1}"><small>${field[1]}</small><b>${field[0]}</b></span>`).join('')}<i class="schema-line line-1"></i><i class="schema-line line-2"></i><i class="schema-line line-3"></i><i class="schema-line line-4"></i><i class="schema-line line-5"></i><i class="schema-line line-6"></i></div><div class="schema-summary"><div class="schema-summary-head"><div><small>SCHEMA PROFILE</small><b>${model.desc}</b></div><span class="status ok">${model.version||'V1.0'} · 已发布</span></div><dl><div><dt>${model.fields.length}</dt><dd>定义字段</dd></div><div><dt>${fields.length}</dt><dd>核心属性</dd></div><div><dt>5</dt><dd>实体类型</dd></div><div><dt>${relations.length}</dt><dd>关系类型</dd></div></dl><div class="schema-field-list"><small>核心属性</small>${fields.map(field=>`<span><b>${field[0]}</b><em>${field[1]}</em></span>`).join('')}</div><div class="schema-relation-list"><small>主要关系</small>${relations.map(x=>`<span>${x}</span>`).join('')}</div></div></div></section>`}
function extractV3(){const model=extractionModels.find(x=>x.id===state.selectedModel)||extractionModels[0],set=docSets.find(x=>x.id===state.selectedSet)||docSets[0];return `${context()}${pageHead('STAGE 03 · 领域知识管理员','知识抽取','选择待处理知识集和已内置的知识建模，即可启动知识抽取任务。','')}<div class="process-strip extract-simple-process"><div class="process-step active"><span>1</span><div><b>选择知识集</b><small>确定抽取数据范围</small></div></div><div class="process-step active"><span>2</span><div><b>选择知识建模</b><small>查看并采用图谱 Schema</small></div></div><div class="process-step"><span>3</span><div><b>启动知识抽取</b><small>自动生成结构化知识</small></div></div></div><div class="extract-role-note"><span>i</span><div><b>知识建模由专家与 IT 预先完成</b><p>领域专家在线下设计图谱 Schema，IT 完成技术校验并内置到建模清单。领域知识管理员无需编辑字段或关系，只需选择适用建模。</p></div></div><div class="extract-choice-grid"><section class="panel extract-choice-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><span class="section-kicker">01 · KNOWLEDGE SET</span><h3>选择知识集</h3><small>选择一个已完成解析与接入质检的知识集</small></div><span class="status ok">必选</span></div><div class="extract-set-options">${docSets.map((x,i)=>`<button class="extract-set-option ${x.id===set.id?'selected':''}" data-set="${x.id}"><span class="extract-option-icon">▤</span><span><b>${x.name}知识集</b><small>${['财经知识圈 / 离线上传','iLearning / 3MS','知识圈 / 规则库'][i]} · ${x.count} 条知识</small></span><em>${x.id===set.id?'已选择':'选择'}</em></button>`).join('')}</div></section><section class="panel extract-choice-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><span class="section-kicker">02 · KNOWLEDGE MODELING</span><h3>选择知识建模</h3><small>建模已通过专家评审与 IT 技术校验</small></div><span class="status info">IT 内置</span></div><div class="extract-model-options">${extractionModels.map(x=>`<button class="extract-model-option ${x.id===model.id?'selected':''}" data-model="${x.id}"><span class="extract-option-icon schema">◇</span><span><b>${x.name} Schema</b><small>${x.desc}</small></span><em>预览中</em></button>`).join('')}</div></section></div>${extractSchemaPreview(model)}<div class="extract-launch-bar"><div><span>READY TO EXTRACT</span><b>${set.name}知识集</b><i>×</i><b>${model.name} Schema</b><small>系统将自动读取知识内容，按所选 Schema 识别实体、属性与关系。</small></div><button class="btn primary extract-launch-button" data-action="run-extract-task">启动知识抽取任务 →</button></div>`}
function extractTaskStatus(task){if(task.status==='已完成')return '<span class="status ok">已完成</span>';if(task.status==='运行中')return '<span class="status info">运行中</span>';return '<span class="status warn">待运行</span>'}
function extractTaskListPage(){
  const running=extractTasks.filter(x=>x.status==='运行中').length,completed=extractTasks.filter(x=>x.status==='已完成').length,totalKnowledge=extractTasks.reduce((sum,x)=>sum+x.count,0);
  return `${context()}${pageHead('STAGE 03 · 领域知识管理员','知识抽取任务','创建、运行并跟踪知识抽取任务。','<button class="btn primary" data-action="create-extract-task">＋ 创建知识抽取任务</button>')}<div class="extract-task-metrics"><section><small>任务总数</small><b>${extractTasks.length}</b></section><section><small>运行中</small><b>${running}</b></section><section><small>已完成</small><b>${completed}</b></section><section><small>待抽取文件</small><b>${totalKnowledge}</b></section></div><section class="panel extract-task-list-panel"><div class="panel-head"><h3>知识抽取任务列表</h3><div class="extract-task-toolbar"><div class="search"><span>⌕</span><input placeholder="搜索任务名称或编号"></div><select aria-label="任务状态"><option>全部状态</option><option>待运行</option><option>运行中</option><option>已完成</option></select></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table extract-task-table"><thead><tr><th>任务编号 / 名称</th><th>待抽取文件清单</th><th>知识建模</th><th>文件量</th><th>创建信息</th><th>最近运行</th><th>状态</th><th>质量检查结果</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody>${extractTasks.map(task=>`<tr><td><code>${task.id}</code><b>${task.name}</b></td><td><span class="task-source-name">▤ ${task.set}</span></td><td><span class="task-schema-name">◇ ${task.model}</span></td><td><b>${task.count}</b> 个</td><td><span>${task.creator}</span><small>${task.created}</small></td><td>${task.latest}${task.status==='运行中'?`<div class="task-progress"><i style="width:${task.progress}%"></i></div>`:''}</td><td>${extractTaskStatus(task)}</td><td><span class="quality-result-label">${task.status==='已完成'?'点击查看':'-'}</span></td><td><div class="row-actions">${task.status==='运行中'?'<button disabled>运行中</button>':`<button class="primary-action" data-action="run-extract-task-row" data-task-id="${task.id}">${task.status==='已完成'?'再次运行':'运行'}</button>`}${task.status==='已完成'?`<button data-action="view-extract-result" data-task-id="${task.id}">查看结果</button>`:''}</div></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div></section>`
}
function review(){const r=records.find(x=>x.id===state.selectedRecord);return `${context()}${pageHead('STAGE 04 · 领域知识专家','专家确认抽取结果','领域知识专家逐条核对证据、修订字段，也可放弃或人工补录知识。','<button class="btn" data-action="add-record">＋ 补录知识</button><button class="btn primary" data-action="batch-confirm">批量确认高置信结果</button>')}<div class="review-layout"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h3>待确认知识</h3>${badge('12 条')}</div><div class="record-list">${records.map(x=>`<div class="record ${x.id===r.id?'active':''}" data-record="${x.id}"><div class="record-top"><b>${x.title}</b><span class="confidence">${x.confidence}%</span></div><p>${x.type} · ${x.status}</p></div>`).join('')}</div></div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h3>${r.title}</h3>${badge(r.status)}</div><div class="panel-body"><div class="form-grid">${[['知识类型',r.type],['预警指标',r.indicator],['规则逻辑',r.logic],['阈值条件',r.threshold],['适用范围',`${domain().region} / ${domain().object}`],['处置建议',r.advice]].map((x,i)=>`<div class="form-field ${i===5?'full':''}"><label>${x[0]}</label>${i===5?`<textarea>${x[1]}</textarea>`:`<input value="${esc(x[1])}">`}</div>`).join('')}</div><div class="evidence" style="margin-top:14px"><b>来源证据：</b>经营分析报告第 18 页。<mark>销售收入环比下降达到 15% 时触发黄色预警</mark>。抽取规则 V3，置信度 ${r.confidence}%。</div><div class="action-bar"><button class="btn danger" data-action="drop-record">放弃</button><span class="spacer"></span><button class="btn" data-action="save-record">保存修改</button><button class="btn success" data-action="confirm-record">确认知识</button></div></div></div></div><div class="action-bar"><span class="spacer"></span><button class="btn primary" data-action="submit-approval">提交审批与认证 →</button></div>`}
function approval(){return `${context()}${pageHead('STAGE 05 · 责任人 / 专委会','审批与知识认证','责任人判断知识是否可用，领域专委会最终定性是否成为组织级知识。','')}<div class="approval-flow"><div class="approval-step done"><span class="step-no">✓</span><h3>知识专家提交</h3><p>确认、修订并说明来源证据。</p><div class="approval-meta"><span>王璐 · 今天 10:42</span><span>12 条知识</span></div></div><div class="approval-arrow">→</div><div class="approval-step ${state.approved?'done':'active'}"><span class="step-no">${state.approved?'✓':'2'}</span><h3>领域知识责任人审批</h3><p>判断内容准确性、范围和可用性。</p><div class="approval-meta"><span>陈思远</span><span>${state.approved?'已通过':'待处理'}</span></div>${!state.approved?'<div class="action-bar"><button class="btn danger small" data-action="reject-owner">驳回</button><button class="btn success small" data-action="approve-owner">通过</button></div>':''}</div><div class="approval-arrow">→</div><div class="approval-step ${state.certified?'done':state.approved?'active':''}"><span class="step-no">${state.certified?'✓':'3'}</span><h3>领域专委会定性</h3><p>判断能否成为跨团队复用的组织级知识。</p><div class="approval-meta"><span>${domain().owner}</span><span>${state.certified?'组织级知识':state.approved?'待定性':'等待审批'}</span></div>${state.approved&&!state.certified?'<div class="action-bar"><button class="btn small" data-action="domain-only">仅领域知识</button><button class="btn primary small" data-action="certify">认证组织级</button></div>':''}</div></div><div class="panel" style="margin-top:15px"><div class="panel-head"><h3>知识包摘要</h3>${badge(state.certified?'已认证':state.approved?'待定性':'待审批')}</div><div class="panel-body grid cols-3"><div class="metric"><small>知识条目</small><strong>12</strong><span class="status ok">完整率 100%</span></div><div class="metric"><small>平均置信度</small><strong>93%</strong><span class="status ok">质量通过</span></div><div class="metric"><small>预计服务</small><strong>3</strong><span class="status info">可构建模式</span></div></div></div>${state.certified?'<div class="action-bar"><span class="spacer"></span><button class="btn primary" data-route="service">构建知识服务 →</button></div>':''}`}
function service(){const t=serviceTypes[state.serviceMode];return `${context()}${pageHead('STAGE 06 · 领域知识管理员 / IT','正式入库与知识服务构建','审批后的知识在此生成正式版本，并按消费需求构建语义、精确或混合检索服务。',`<button class="btn">版本历史</button><button class="btn primary" data-action="publish-service">${state.published?'服务已发布':'构建并发布'}</button>`)}<div class="service-modes">${Object.entries(serviceTypes).map(([id,x])=>`<button class="service-mode ${id===state.serviceMode?'active':''}" data-mode="${id}"><span class="service-icon">${x.icon}</span><span class="status ${id==='hybrid'?'ok':'info'}">${x.tag}${id==='hybrid'?' · 推荐':''}</span><h3>${x.name}</h3><p>${x.desc}</p><footer>${x.steps.join(' → ')}</footer></button>`).join('')}</div><div class="service-layout"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>${t.name}配置</h3><small>${t.tag}</small></div>${badge(state.published?'正式服务':state.built?'已构建':'待构建')}</div><div class="panel-body"><div class="form-grid"><div class="form-field"><label>正式知识版本</label><select><option>${domain().scene}知识包 V1.0 · 12 条</option></select></div><div class="form-field"><label>服务名称</label><input value="${domain().name}-${domain().scene}-${t.name}"></div><div class="form-field"><label>对象与场景过滤</label><input value="${domain().object} / ${domain().scene} / ${domain().region}"></div><div class="form-field"><label>更新策略</label><select><option>知识版本发布后自动增量更新</option></select></div></div><div class="pipeline"><div class="pipeline-node done"><span>✓</span><b>正式知识入库</b><small>V1.0 · 可追溯</small></div><i>→</i>${t.steps.map((x,i)=>`<div class="pipeline-node ${state.built?'done':i===0?'active':''}"><span>${state.built?'✓':i+2}</span><b>${x}</b><small>${state.built?'完成':'待执行'}</small></div>${i<t.steps.length-1?'<i>→</i>':''}`).join('')}<i>→</i><div class="pipeline-node ${state.published?'done':''}"><span>${state.published?'✓':'◎'}</span><b>服务发布</b><small>API / MCP</small></div></div><div class="endpoint"><span><small>调用地址</small><code>${t.endpoint}</code></span><button class="btn small" data-action="copy-endpoint">复制</button></div></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h3>检索效果预览</h3><span class="status info">${t.tag}</span></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="preview-query">${state.serviceMode==='graph'?'对象=渠道业绩 AND 阈值≥15%':'收入下降多少需要预警？'}<button class="btn primary small" data-action="test-service">测试</button></div><div class="result-card"><div><span class="status ok">命中 0.96</span><b>渠道销售收入环比降幅预警</b></div><p>本期销售收入环比下降 ≥ 15% 时触发黄色预警，下钻客户与产品线定位损失来源。</p><footer>来源：Q3 经营分析报告第 18 页 · 组织级知识 V1.0</footer></div><div class="service-facts">${[['检索路径',state.serviceMode==='hybrid'?'语义召回 + 图谱精排':state.serviceMode==='slice'?'向量语义召回':'图谱条件匹配'],['预计知识量','12 条'],['证据可追溯','100%'],['消费方式','API / MCP / Agent']].map(x=>`<span><small>${x[0]}</small><b>${x[1]}</b></span>`).join('')}</div></div></div></div>`}
function operations(){return `${pageHead('OPERATIONS','知识运营看板','跨领域观察知识资产、旅程效率、服务运行和反馈闭环；不打断领域内生产流程。','<button class="btn">导出周报</button><button class="btn primary">运营配置</button>')}<div class="grid cols-4">${[['领域知识','860','本月 +74'],['组织级知识','642','认证率 74.7%'],['知识服务','15','运行中 13'],['近 30 天调用','26,840','↑ 18.6%']].map((x,i)=>`<div class="card metric"><small>${x[0]}</small><strong>${x[1]}</strong><span class="${i===2?'status warn':'delta'}">${x[2]}</span></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="ops-grid"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h3>各领域资产与服务</h3><span class="status info">近 30 天</span></div><div class="panel-body ops-bars">${domains.map(d=>`<div class="bar-row"><span class="bar-label"><i style="background:${d.color}"></i>${d.name}</span><span class="bar-track"><i style="width:${d.org/3.5}%;background:${d.color}"></i></span><b>${d.org}</b><small>${d.services} 个服务</small></div>`).join('')}</div></div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h3>旅程转化</h3><span class="status ok">整体健康</span></div><div class="panel-body funnel">${[['接入文档','381','100%'],['准入文档','342','89.8%'],['抽取知识','1,124','—'],['专家确认','968','86.1%'],['审批通过','860','88.8%'],['服务可用','15','13 运行中']].map((x,i)=>`<div style="--w:${100-i*8}%"><span>${i+1}</span><b>${x[0]}</b><strong>${x[1]}</strong><small>${x[2]}</small></div>`).join('')}</div></div></div><div class="panel" style="margin-top:15px"><div class="panel-head"><h3>知识服务运行状态</h3><span class="status ok">总体可用性 99.92%</span></div><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>领域</th><th>服务</th><th>模式</th><th>知识版本</th><th>今日调用</th><th>命中率</th><th>P95 延迟</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody>${[['智能分析','收入经营知识服务','混合模式','V1.3','2,486','91.6%','182 ms','运行中'],['合同管理','条款风险检索','知识图谱','V2.1','1,208','96.2%','96 ms','运行中'],['项目管理','交付经验问答','知识切片','V1.0','864','84.7%','214 ms','运行中'],['客户经营','商机转化助手','混合模式','V0.9','326','79.1%','238 ms','待优化']].map(x=>`<tr>${x.slice(0,7).map((v,i)=>`<td>${i===1?'<b>'+v+'</b>':v}</td>`).join('')}<td>${badge(x[7])}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`}
