function intake(){const d=domain();const tabs=[['integration','知识集成','系统集成与离线上传'],['set','知识集构建','自动规则与手动添加'],['tagging','知识打标签','场景标签与批量操作']];return `${context()}${pageHead('STAGE 01 · 领域知识管理员','知识接入',`在“${d.name}”领域完成知识集成、知识集构建与场景化打标。`,'<button class="btn">接入日志</button>')}<div class="intake-tabs">${tabs.map((x,i)=>`<button class="intake-tab ${state.intakeTab===x[0]?'active':''}" data-intake-tab="${x[0]}"><span>${i+1}</span><b>${x[1]}</b><small>${x[2]}</small></button>`).join('')}</div>${state.intakeTab==='integration'?`<div class="integration-switch"><button class="${state.integrationMode==='system'?'active':''}" data-integration-mode="system">系统集成 <small>8 条管道</small></button><button class="${state.integrationMode==='offline'?'active':''}" data-integration-mode="offline">离线上传 <small>多格式文档</small></button></div>${integrationPanel()}`:state.intakeTab==='set'?setBuildPanel():taggingPanel()}<div class="action-bar"><span class="notice">知识集每日 00:00 自动执行规则添加与质量检查，所有变更均记录操作日志。</span><span class="spacer"></span><button class="btn primary" data-action="finish-intake">完成知识接入并进入解析 →</button></div>`}

function integrationPage(){const d=domain();return `${context()}${pageHead('原始知识接入 01 / 03 · 领域知识管理员','集成',`查看“${d.name}”领域的系统集成状态并补充离线文件。`,'<button class="btn">接入日志</button>')}${unifiedIntegrationPanel()}<div class="action-bar"><span class="phase-next-note">原始知识接入 · 第 1 步，共 3 步</span><span class="spacer"></span><button class="btn primary" data-route="selection">下一步：筛选 →</button></div>`}
function selectionPanel(){const d=domain();return `<div class="set-workbench"><aside class="panel set-sidebar"><div class="panel-head"><h3>文件清单</h3><button class="btn small" data-action="create-knowledge-set">＋ 创建</button></div><div class="set-list"><div class="set-item active"><b>智能分析文件清单</b><p>自动规则 + 手动维护</p><small>26 个文件 · 今日新增 3 个</small></div></div></aside><div><div class="rule-grid selection-rule-grid"><div class="rule-card ${state.autoRule?'enabled':''}"><div><span class="rule-icon">⌕</span><b>自动添加筛选规则</b><small>按管道字段筛选并自动加入文件清单</small></div><span class="status ok">已配置</span><p>知识圈：圈子名称、发布时间 · 3MS：责任部门、文档类型、专业领域、发布时间</p><button class="btn small" data-action="config-auto-rule">配置规则</button></div>${scenarioTagRuleCard()}</div><div class="panel" style="margin-top:15px"><div class="panel-head"><h3>智能分析文件清单内容</h3><div class="set-actions"><div class="search knowledge-set-search"><span>⌕</span><input data-knowledge-filter="title" placeholder="搜索文件标题"></div><button class="btn small" data-action="manual-add">手动添加</button></div></div>${knowledgeMemberTable()}<div class="batch-footer"><span>已选择 ${state.selectedKnowledge.size} 个文件</span><span class="spacer"></span><button class="btn danger small" data-action="remove-knowledge">从文件清单移除</button><button class="btn small" data-action="go-tagging">批量打标签</button><button class="btn primary small" data-action="run-selection-quality">质量检查</button></div></div></div></div>`}
function selectionPage(){return `${context()}${pageHead('原始知识接入 02 / 03 · 领域知识管理员','筛选','配置筛选规则与场景标签，形成目标文件清单。','<button class="btn">筛选任务记录</button>')}${selectionPanel()}<div class="action-bar"><span class="phase-next-note">原始知识接入 · 第 2 步，共 3 步</span><span class="spacer"></span><button class="btn primary" data-action="submit-raw-certification">下一步：认证 →</button></div>`}
function qualityScore(score){const cls=score>=90?'high':score>=80?'medium':'low';return `<span class="quality-score ${cls}"><b>${score}</b><small>/100</small></span>`}
function qualityRuleCards(mode){const structured=mode==='structured';return `<div class="quality-rule-grid"><section class="quality-rule-card enabled"><header><span>01</span><div><b>${structured?'字段完整性':'内容完整性'}</b><small>${structured?'必填字段、数据类型与空值检查':'全文字数、正文完整与来源信息'}</small></div>${badge('已配置')}</header><p>${structured?'必填字段完整率 ≥ 95%，枚举值必须在知识结构定义范围内':'全文字数 > 500，来源与创建人不能为空'}</p><button class="btn small" data-action="config-quality-rule">配置规则</button></section><section class="quality-rule-card enabled"><header><span>02</span><div><b>${structured?'结构一致性':'场景标签命中'}</b><small>${structured?'模型约束、跨字段逻辑与重复知识':'责任中心 / 业务域 / 对象 / 主题 / 适用区域'}</small></div>${badge('AI + 规则')}</header><p>${structured?'字段类型一致，逻辑冲突率 ≤ 5%，相似知识重复度 ≤ 15%':'5 个标签维度至少命中 3 个枚举维度'}</p><button class="btn small" data-action="config-quality-rule">配置规则</button></section>${structured?`<section class="quality-rule-card enabled"><header><span>03</span><div><b>抽取准确性</b><small>字段值与原文证据的一致程度</small></div>${badge('AI 判断')}</header><p>证据可溯源率 100%，AI 准确性评分 ≥ 80</p><button class="btn small" data-action="config-quality-rule">配置规则</button></section>`:`<section class="quality-rule-card enabled multimodal"><header><span>03</span><div><b>多模态解析结果检查</b><small>文本、表格、图表与图片解析质量</small></div>${badge('已启用')}</header><p>文本完整性 ≥ 90%，表格识别率 ≥ 85%，低分结果转人工确认</p><button class="btn small" data-action="preview-parse">查看解析预览</button></section>`}</div>`}
function qualityResultTable(mode){const structured=mode==='structured';if(structured){const rows=Object.entries(reviewResults).flatMap(([model,items])=>items.slice(0,2).map(x=>({...x,model:knowledgeModels.find(m=>m.id===model)?.name||model})));return `<div class="quality-table-wrap"><table class="data-table quality-result-table"><thead><tr><th>知识编码</th><th>抽取知识</th><th>知识结构</th><th>完整性</th><th>一致性</th><th>证据准确性</th><th>质量得分</th><th>结果</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map((x,i)=>{const score=Math.max(78,x.confidence-(i%3));return `<tr><td><code>${x.id}</code></td><td><b>${x.values['知识标题']}</b></td><td>${x.model}</td><td>${[100,96,92][i%3]}%</td><td>${[96,93,88][i%3]}%</td><td>${x.confidence}%</td><td>${qualityScore(score)}</td><td>${badge(score>=80?'已通过':'待处理')}</td></tr>`}).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`}return `<div class="quality-table-wrap"><table class="data-table quality-result-table"><thead><tr><th>知识标题</th><th>来源</th><th>解析内容</th><th>规则检查</th><th>AI 检查</th><th>质量得分</th><th>结果</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody>${demoDocs.map((x,i)=>`<tr><td><b>${x.name}</b></td><td>${x.source}</td><td>${['文本 34 · 表格 8 · 图表 6','文本 18 · 表格 3','工作表 6 · 关系 24','文本 22 · 图表 9'][i]}</td><td>${i===3?'2 项未通过':'全部通过'}</td><td>${[95,92,89,76][i]}%</td><td>${qualityScore(x.quality)}</td><td>${badge(i===3?'待处理':'已通过')}</td><td><button class="btn small" data-action="preview-parse">查看</button></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`}
function qualityCheckPage(mode){const structured=mode==='structured',phase=structured?'结构化知识准出':'原始知识准入',step=structured?'02':'03';return `${context()}${pageHead(`${phase} ${step} / 05 · 领域知识管理员`,'质量检查',structured?'检查结构化知识的完整性、一致性和准确性。':'检查原始知识的内容质量与多模态解析结果。',`<button class="btn" data-action="config-quality-rule">＋ 配置检查规则</button><button class="btn primary" data-action="run-quality-check">▶ 执行质量检查</button>`)}<div class="quality-summary"><section><small>待检查</small><b>${structured?'12':'26'}</b><span>条知识</span></section><section><small>检查规则</small><b>3</b><span>组已启用</span></section><section><small>平均质量分</small><b>${structured?'91':'86'}</b><span>/ 100</span></section><section><small>检查通过率</small><b>${structured?'91.7':'84.6'}%</b><span>${structured?'11':'22'} 条通过</span></section></div><section class="panel quality-results-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>${structured?'结构化知识':'原始知识 / 文档'}质量检查结果</h3><small>质量阈值以下的知识需处理后重新检查</small></div><span class="status info">质量阈值 ≥ 80</span></div>${qualityResultTable(mode)}</section><div class="action-bar"><span class="phase-next-note">${phase} · 第 ${Number(step)} 步，共 5 步</span><span class="spacer"></span><button class="btn primary" data-action="submit-quality-review" data-quality-mode="${mode}">下一步：知识审核 →</button></div>`}
function rawReviewPage(){if(!state.reviewWorkItem)return workQueuePage('review','知识审核','领域知识专家','审核质量检查通过的原始知识集，确认内容、来源、标签与适用范围。','raw','raw-review').replace('STAGE 04','原始知识准入 04 / 05');const item=workQueueData('review').find(x=>x.id===state.reviewWorkItem&&x.type==='raw');if(!item){state.reviewWorkItem=null;return rawReviewPage()}return reviewV3().replace('STAGE 04','原始知识准入 04 / 05').replace('提交领域知识责任人审批','提交领域专委会认证').replace('提交知识审批 →','下一步：知识认证 →')}
function rawFileCertificationDetail(item){return `${context()}${pageHead('原始知识接入 03 / 03 · 领域专委会责任人','认证',`正在认证“${item.name}”，认证结果将形成可独立使用的原始文件包。`,'<button class="btn" data-action="back-work-queue">← 返回待认证列表</button>')}${governanceRoleBanner('03','认证','领域专委会责任人','确认该文件清单是否通过组织级认证',state.certified?'认证完成':'待认证')}<div class="selected-work-item"><span class="raw">▤</span><div><small>原始文件清单</small><b>${item.name}</b><p>${item.source} · ${item.count} 个文件 · 质量检查通过</p></div>${badge(state.certified?'已认证':'认证中')}</div><section class="panel approval-list-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>待认证原始文件</h3><small>${item.name}</small></div>${badge('质量检查通过')}</div>${rawFileCertificationTable()}</section><div class="certification-decision"><div><span>ORGANIZATION FILE CERTIFICATION</span><h3>专委会认证意见</h3><p>该文件清单来源可信、适用边界清晰，具备跨团队复用价值。</p></div><div class="certification-score"><span><b>组织价值</b><em>高</em></span><span><b>复用范围</b><em>广</em></span><span><b>来源可信</b><em>100%</em></span><span><b>治理风险</b><em>低</em></span></div><div class="certification-actions">${state.certified?'<button class="btn primary" data-route="extract">进入结构化知识加工 →</button>':'<button class="btn" data-action="domain-only">保留为领域级</button><button class="btn primary" data-action="certify">通过组织级认证</button>'}</div></div>`}
function rawCertificationPage(){if(!state.certificationWorkItem)return workQueuePage('certification','认证','领域专委会责任人','对筛选与质量检查通过的文件清单进行最终定性，完成原始知识接入。','raw','raw-certification').replace('STAGE 06','原始知识接入 03 / 03').replaceAll('审批通过','质量检查通过');const item=workQueueData('certification').find(x=>x.id===state.certificationWorkItem&&x.type==='raw');if(!item){state.certificationWorkItem=null;return rawCertificationPage()}return rawFileCertificationDetail(item)}
